<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>We’re mapping your market – here’s what’s next</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="container" padding="0">
      <adv-header />

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Hi <strong>{{ first_name }}, </strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          You've been added to our <strong>beta queue.</strong> We personally
          work through every <strong>Rival Report</strong> — yours is in line
          and we'll send it the moment it's ready.
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Our team is pulling competitive data for
          <a href="{{ product_link }}">{{ product_title }}</a> identifying your
          true rivals — the handful actually pulling customers away from you –
          and building the strategic picture of who's winning and why.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          We're in beta and keeping intake intentionally limited. Every report
          gets a human review before it lands in your inbox – that's what
          separates intelligence from just another dashboard.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text> In the meantime, here‘s what to expect: </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-raw>
          <ul style="padding-left: 26px; margin: 0;"> <li><strong>🔎 Your true
          rivals identified</strong> – not all 250 competitors, just the ones
          that actually matter to your revenue</li> <li><strong>🏆 Where you can
          win</strong> – specific vulnerabilities you can exploit</li>
          <li><strong>👀 What to watch</strong> – market shifts that could
          impact your sales</li> </ul>
        </mj-raw>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Most Amazon sellers spend 20-40 hours per week trying to track
          competitors manually. You won’t have to.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text>
          You'll see what competitors are doing and how customers are responding
          – not days or weeks later, but as it happens.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <ai-btn-ico
        classes="btn-wrapper"
        href="https://vimeo.com/1166666934?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci"
        iconSrc="https://app-stg.amaizing.io/pngs/play-circle.png"
        >What’s in Your Rival Report</ai-btn-ico
      >

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          We'll be in touch as soon as your <strong>Rival Report</strong> is
          ready.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text> Thanks, </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          The
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >
          Team
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <adv-footer />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
